"\"use strict\";Object.defineProperty(exports,\"__esModule\",{value:true});Object.defineProperty(exports,\"default\",{enumerable:true,get:function(){return MDXContent}});function _extends(){_extends=Object.assign||function(target){for(var i=1;i<arguments.length;i++){var source=arguments[i];for(var key in source){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(source,key)){target[key]=source[key]}}}return target};return _extends.apply(this,arguments)}function _createMdxContent(props){var _components=_extends({blockquote:\"blockquote\",em:\"em\",h2:\"h2\",p:\"p\"},props.components);return Vue.h(Vue.Fragment,null,Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Xiaoyu’er was a bus and train enthusiast from Nanjing who, like many transgender people, simply wished to make herself look beautiful.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Xiaoyu’er—it seems quite a few people go by this handle, too.\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Sudden Tragic News\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"A message, a phone call, and a silent, motionless silence. Only the songs playing in the earphones kept echoing on and on.\")),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"On October 11, 2026, LinWaterMoon woke up as usual—a little early that day, waking at 7:30 AM. He picked up his phone to check his messages as usual, and saw a message Xiaoyu’er had sent at 2:30 in the morning: “Goodnight. Only you won’t save me,” along with several photos showing chemical reagent bottles.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At noon that day, LinWaterMoon received a call from a police officer in Nanjing… From that moment on, the music in his earphones never stopped for the rest of the day…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“But you clearly promised you were coming to visit me over winter break...”\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In her suicide note, Xiaoyu’er wrote that for about four years she had longed to have attractive features, longed to become a cute, beloved girl, and even wanted to become a femboy or live as a trans girl. But in reality, she felt extreme disgust and inferiority toward her facial features, voice, figure, and body hair—even viewing herself as an “aqua-themed femboy exam-grub,”\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-1\",id:\"footnote-ref-1\"},\"1\")),\" utterly unworthy of being a trans girl. She thought she was very ugly; every time she saw a cute femboy or a pretty girl online, an intense yearning would well up inside her. She had hoped to change her situation by wearing nice clothes and cosplaying anime characters, but because she lacked the confidence and courage to express herself, and was terrified of others noticing the changes or facing her family’s interference and opposition, she ultimately gave up trying. She once dreamed that her HRT regimen was discovered, and dreamed her mother said to her: “If you keep going with this, I’ll kill you!” Yet she insisted on continuing, and so in the dream, she was killed. It might sound somewhat ridiculous—but she really did have such a dream.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Her suicide was not out of hope for a better reincarnation in the next life; she simply wanted to end everything.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If you cannot choose the process, and it is not a process you like, it is better to end everything early.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Written like a pile of shit—I know I write terribly, but this is all I can manage.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Goodnight, world.\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In the early hours of October 11, 2026, she finally made up her mind—to leave this world and end it all.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Her Parents Came Looking\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"A few days later, LinWaterMoon met Xiaoyu’er’s parents—her mom and dad came together. “I’d better step outside for a moment,” her mom choked back tears as soon as she sat down. “Hearing this is still a bit too painful for me…”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“He [sic] must have left quite bravely—quite resolutely. He probably had no attachments left to this world… Over the past few years, he was taking leave from school and returning intermittently; he had very few friends—maybe because he was naturally quite insecure. He didn’t want to depend on the family or take our money; he wanted to earn a living through his own ability… He cried and shared some of what was in his heart with me. Before, he was afraid the family would object, so he didn’t dare say anything. He said he wanted to keep a cat, and that he also wanted to make himself pretty…” Xiaoyu’er’s father said calmly.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Xiaoyu’er once said that she and LinWaterMoon were very much alike—very similar in personality, yet somehow different as well.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“I like LinWaterMoon the most,” Xiaoyu’er once said.\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Just a few days before Xiaoyu’er left, she said she wanted to keep a cat. Her family agreed and promised to buy her one. They had planned to go on the 11th to buy the cat she had picked out and bring it home—but that cat would never meet the owner who belonged to it.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"A Hastily Written Ending\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"That day, the cat was still curled up in the pet shop, while Xiaoyu’er was forever frozen in that icy early morning. She took with her all the unutterable struggles and self-loathing, leaving this world with nothing but that softly spoken “Goodnight,” and “Only you won’t save me.” The sun rose as usual, but it could no longer reach the shadow in Xiaoyu’er’s heart. And for those who cared about her, this quiet farewell remains a wound that will never heal.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Contributor for this entry: LinWaterMoon\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"ol\",null,Vue.h(\"li\",{id:\"footnote-1\"},\"Aqua-Themed Femboy Exam-Grub: A self-deprecating compound term coined by Xiaoyu’er. “Aqua-themed” refers to a light-blue/pastel-aqua fashion aesthetic common in subculture fashion; “femboy” refers to an effeminate or cute cross-dressing boy/trans-feminine individual; “exam-grub” is a harsh China mainland internet slur for someone who does nothing but grind practice exams without real life or taste. Combined, it conveys a self-loathing stereotype within the community: a test-grinding femboy who, even dressed in pastel aqua outfits, is mocked for having poor aesthetic taste and being unable to shake off the drab, soul-crushing aura of an exam drill machine. Xiaoyu’er used it to put herself down—feeling that no matter how much she longed to be a pretty trans girl, she was ultimately just a “exam grub” beyond saving, even in nice clothes.\",Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-ref-1\"},Vue.h(\"svg\",{viewBox:\"0 0 16 16\",version:\"1.1\",id:\"svg1\",\"xmlns:xlink\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",xmlns:\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"xmlns:svg\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",style:\"margin-left: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: -2px; width: 1rem; height: 1rem\"},Vue.h(\"defs\",{id:\"defs1\"},Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient3\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop3\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop4\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient1\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop1\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop2\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient1\",id:\"linearGradient2\",x1:\"2.6681123\",y1:\"8\",x2:\"13.331888\",y2:\"8\",gradientUnits:\"userSpaceOnUse\",gradientTransform:\"translate(2.6678295,-2)\"}),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient3\",id:\"linearGradient4\",x1:\"3.7075224\",y1:\"8\",x2:\"12.292478\",y2:\"8\",gradientUnits:\"userSpaceOnUse\"})),Vue.h(\"g\",{id:\"layer1\",transform:\"translate(0,2)\"},Vue.h(\"circle\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:url(#linearGradient2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",id:\"path1\",cx:\"10.667834\",cy:\"6\",r:\"4.5818877\"}),Vue.h(\"path\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:#ff8373;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",d:\"M 9.9178343,10.577036 H 1.7971455\",id:\"path2\"}),Vue.h(\"path\",{style:\"fill:#cccccc;fill-opacity:0;stroke:url(#linearGradient4);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:square;paint-order:stroke fill markers\",id:\"path3\",d:\"M 8.0000001,11.231817 4.7681825,8.0000001 7.9999999,4.7681825 11.231817,7.9999999 Z\",transform:\"translate(-3.6894439,2.577036)\"})))))))}function MDXContent(props){if(props===void 0)props={};var _ref=props.components||{},MDXLayout=_ref.wrapper;return MDXLayout?Vue.h(MDXLayout,_extends({},props),Vue.h(_createMdxContent,_extends({},props))):_createMdxContent(props)}"